ble-of-contents__entry" href="#lego-storage-faq">LEGO Storage FAQ</a><ul class="kb-table-of-contents-list-sub"><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#what-is-the-best-way-to-store-a-lot-of-lego">What is the best way to store a lot of LEGO?</a></li><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#should-you-sort-lego-by-color">Should you sort LEGO by color?</a></li><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#how-do-you-store-built-lego-sets">How do you store built LEGO sets?</a></li><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#how-do-you-store-lego-in-a-small-space">How do you store LEGO in a small space?</a></li></ul></li><li><a class="kb-table-of-contents__entry" href="#final-thoughts">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></div></nav>


<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Sort Only as Much as You Need</h2>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The biggest mistake is building a huge sorting system for a small collection. Match the system to how many bricks you have, and add more sorting only when finding pieces starts to get frustrating.</p>



<figure class="dsh-diagram" style="margin:2em 0;"><svg viewBox="0 0 1200 900" width="100%" role="img" aria-labelledby="dslg-t dslg-d" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="font-family:Poppins,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;height:auto;display:block;border-radius:12px;"><title id="dslg-t">How to sort building bricks by collection size</title><desc id="dslg-d">Three ways to sort toy building bricks as a collection grows. Small collection: one bin or a play mat bag, with no sorting needed. Medium collection: six to eight bins sorted by piece type, such as bricks, plates, tiles, slopes, wheels and special pieces. Large collection: a drawer cabinet, sorted by type first and then by color in bigger drawers. Tip: sort by shape, not color, because builders look for the right shape first.</desc><rect width="1200" height="900" fill="#F7F1E9"/><text x="60" y="84" font-size="44" font-weight="700" fill="#342E2A">How to Sort Building Bricks by Collection Size</text><text x="60" y="124" font-size="24" fill="#6E645C">sort only as much as your collection needs</text><line x1="80" y1="170" x2="1100" y2="170" stroke="#C85A32" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M1100 170 l-14 -8 v16 z" fill="#C85A32"/><text x="590" y="160" font-size="17" fill="#C85A32" text-anchor="middle">collection grows</text><rect x="60" y="200" width="320" height="520" rx="18" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#D8CBBB" stroke-width="2"/><text x="220" y="248" font-size="28" font-weight="700" fill="#342E2A" text-anchor="middle">SMALL</text><text x="220" y="276" font-size="17" fill="#6E645C" text-anchor="middle">a few sets</text><text x="220" y="610" font-size="20" font-weight="700" fill="#342E2A" text-anchor="middle">One bin or play mat bag</text><text x="220" y="642" font-size="16" fill="#6E645C" text-anchor="middle">Toss everything in and play.</text><text x="220" y="664" font-size="16" fill="#6E645C" text-anchor="middle">No sorting needed yet.</text><rect x="440" y="200" width="320" height="520" rx="18" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#D8CBBB" stroke-width="2"/><text x="600" y="248" font-size="28" font-weight="700" fill="#342E2A" text-anchor="middle">MEDIUM</text><text x="600" y="276" font-size="17" fill="#6E645C" text-anchor="middle">a growing mix</text><text x="600" y="610" font-size="20" font-weight="700" fill="#342E2A" text-anchor="middle">6 to 8 bins by piece type</text><text x="600" y="642" font-size="16" fill="#6E645C" text-anchor="middle">bricks, plates, tiles, slopes,</text><text x="600" y="664" font-size="16" fill="#6E645C" text-anchor="middle">wheels and special pieces</text><rect x="820" y="200" width="320" height="520" rx="18" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#D8CBBB" stroke-width="2"/><text x="980" y="248" font-size="28" font-weight="700" fill="#342E2A" text-anchor="middle">LARGE</text><text x="980" y="276" font-size="17" fill="#6E645C" text-anchor="middle">a big collection</text><text x="980" y="610" font-size="20" font-weight="700" fill="#342E2A" text-anchor="middle">Drawer cabinet</text><text x="980" y="642" font-size="16" fill="#6E645C" text-anchor="middle">sort by type first, then</text><text x="980" y="664" font-size="16" fill="#6E645C" text-anchor="middle">by color in bigger drawers</text><path d="M130 380 L310 380 L292 560 L148 560 Z" fill="#ECCDA0" stroke="#B98A5E" stroke-width="3"/><rect x="146" y="392" width="40" height="20" rx="3" fill="#C85A32"/><rect x="154" y="387" width="8" height="5" rx="1" fill="#C85A32"/><rect x="170" y="387" width="8" height="5" rx="1" fill="#C85A32"/><rect x="192" y="396" width="32" height="20" rx="3" fill="#ECCDA0"/><rect x="198" y="391" width="8" height="5" rx="1" fill="#ECCDA0"/><rect x="210" y="391" width="8" height="5" rx="1" fill="#ECCDA0"/><rect x="230" y="390" width="44" height="20" rx="3" fill="#8FA689"/><rect x="239" y="385" width="8" height="5" rx="1" fill="#8FA689"/><rect x="257" y="385" width="8" height="5" rx="1" fill="#8FA689"/><rect x="280" y="394" width="36" height="20" rx="3" fill="#5E7A9A"/><rect x="287" y="389" width="8" height="5" r